{"id":32,"source":"api.quran.com/v4/quran/verses/uthmani_tajweed","updated":"2026-08-23","verses":[{"id":1,"tajweed":"ا<span class=\"tj tj-madda_necessary\">لٓ</span><span class=\"tj tj-madda_necessary\">مٓ</span> <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>١</span>"},{"id":2,"tajweed":"تَ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">نز</span>ِيلُ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْكِتَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>بِ لَا رَيْبَ فِيهِ م<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_wo_ghunnah\">ِن ر</span>َّبِّ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْعَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>لَم<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ِي</span>نَ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٢</span>"},{"id":3,"tajweed":"أَمْ يَقُولُونَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>فْتَرَ>ىٰ</span>هُ‌ۚ بَلْ هُوَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْحَقُّ م<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_wo_ghunnah\">ِن ر</span>َّبِّكَ لِتُ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">نذ</span>ِرَ قَوْ<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">مًا م</span>ّ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َآ</span> أَتَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>ه<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_shafawi\">ُم م</span>ّ<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">ِن ن</span>َّذِي<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">رٍ م</span>ِّ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">ن ق</span>َ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">بْ</span>لِكَ لَعَلَّهُمْ يَهْتَد<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ُو</span>نَ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٣</span>"},{"id":4,"tajweed":"ٱللَّهُ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لَّذِى خَلَقَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>سَّمَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>و<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">َٰ</span>تِ وَ<span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْأَرْضَ وَمَا بَيْنَهُمَا فِى سِتَّةِ أَيَّا<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">مٍ ث</span>ُ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">مّ</span>َ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>سْتَوَىٰ عَلَى <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْعَرْشِ‌ۖ مَا لَك<span class=\"tj tj-idg