٧</span>"},{"id":8,"tajweed":"ثُ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">مّ</span>َ جَعَلَ نَسْلَهُ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ۥ</span> مِ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">ن س</span>ُلَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>لَ<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">ةٍ م</span>ّ<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">ِن م</span>ّ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َا</span>ٓ<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">ءٍ م</span>َّه<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ِي</span>نٍ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٨</span>"},{"id":9,"tajweed":"ثُ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">مّ</span>َ سَوَّ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ىٰ</span>هُ وَنَفَخَ فِيهِ م<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_wo_ghunnah\">ِن ر</span>ُّوحِه<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ِۦ</span>‌ۖ وَجَعَلَ لَكُمُ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>سَّمْعَ وَ<span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْأَ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">بْ</span>صَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>رَ وَ<span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْأَفْــِٔدَةَ‌ۚ قَلِيل<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">اً م</span>َّا تَشْكُر<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ُو</span>نَ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٩</span>"},{"id":10,"tajweed":"وَقَال<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">ُوٓ</span><span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> أَءِذَا ضَلَلْنَا فِى <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْأَرْضِ أَءِ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َا لَفِى خَلْ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">قٍ ج</span>َدِي<span class=\"tj tj-iqlab\">دِۭ‌ۚ ب</span>َلْ ه<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa_shafawi\">ُم ب</span>ِلِق<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َا</span>ٓءِ رَبِّهِمْ كَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>فِر<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ُو</span>نَ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>١٠</span>"},{"id":11,"tajweed":"۞ قُلْ يَتَوَفَّ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>ك<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_shafawi\">ُم م</span>َّلَكُ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْمَوْتِ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لَّذِى وُكِّلَ بِكُمْ ثُ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">مّ</span>َ إِلَىٰ رَبِّكُمْ تُرْجَع<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ُو</span>نَ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>١١</span>"},{"id":12,"tajweed":"وَلَوْ تَرَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">ىٰٓ</span> إِذِ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْمُ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">جْ</span>رِمُونَ نَاكِسُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> رُءُوسِهِمْ عِ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">ند</span>َ رَبِّهِمْ رَبَّن<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َآ</span> أَ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">بْ</span>صَرْنَا وَسَمِعْنَا فَ<span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>رْجِعْنَا نَعْمَلْ صَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>لِحًا إِ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َا مُوقِن<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ُو</span>نَ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>١٢</span>"},{"id":13,"tajweed":"وَلَوْ شِئْنَا لَأَتَيْنَا كُلَّ نَفْسٍ هُدَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ىٰ</span>هَا وَلَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>كِنْ حَقَّ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْقَوْلُ مِ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>ِى لَأَمْلَأَ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َ جَهَ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َمَ مِنَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْجِ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َةِ وَ<span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span><span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َاسِ أَ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">جْ</span>مَع<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ِي</span>نَ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>١٣</span>"},{"id":14,"tajweed":"فَذُوقُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> بِمَا نَسِيتُمْ لِق<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َا</span>ٓءَ يَوْمِكُمْ هَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>ذ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َآ</span> إِ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َا نَسِينَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>كُمْ‌ۖ وَذُوقُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> عَذَابَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْخُلْدِ بِمَا كُ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">نت</span>ُمْ تَعْمَل<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ُو</span>نَ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>١٤</span>"},{"id":15,"tajweed":"إِ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َمَا يُؤْمِنُ بِـَٔـايَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>تِنَا <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لَّذِينَ إِذَا ذُكِّرُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> بِهَا خَرُّو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> سُجَّ<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">دًا و</span>َسَبَّحُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> بِحَمْدِ رَبِّهِمْ وَهُمْ لَا يَسْتَكْبِرُ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">و</span>نَ ۩ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>١٥</span>"},{"id":16,"tajweed":"تَتَجَافَىٰ جُنُوبُهُمْ عَنِ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْمَضَاجِعِ يَ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">دْ</span>عُونَ رَبَّهُمْ خَوْ<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">فًا و</span>َطَمَ<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">عًا و</span>َمِ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">مّ</span>َا رَزَ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">قْ</span>نَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>هُمْ يُ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">نف</span>ِق<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ُو</span>نَ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>١٦</span>"},{"id":17,"tajweed":"فَلَا تَعْلَمُ نَفْ<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">سٌ م</span>ّ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َآ</span> أُخْفِىَ لَه<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_shafawi\">ُم م</span>ِّ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">ن ق</span>ُرَّةِ أَعْيُ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">نٍ ج</span>َز<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َا</span>ٓ<span class=\"tj tj-iqlab\">ءَۢ ب</span>ِمَا كَانُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> يَعْمَل<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ُو</span>نَ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>١٧</span>"},{"id":18,"tajweed":"أَفَمَ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">ن ك</span>َانَ مُؤْمِ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">نًا ك</span>َمَ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">ن ك</span>َانَ فَاسِ<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_wo_ghunnah\">قًا‌ۚ ل</span>َّا يَسْتَوُ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ۥ</span>نَ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>١٨</span>"},{"id":19,"tajweed":"أَ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">مّ</span>َا <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لَّذِينَ ءَامَنُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> وَعَمِلُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>صَّ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>لِحَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>تِ فَلَهُمْ جَ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>تُ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْمَأْوَىٰ نُزُل<span class=\"tj tj-iqlab\">اَۢ ب</span>ِمَا كَانُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> يَعْمَل<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ُو</span>نَ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>١٩</span>"},{"id":20,"tajweed":"وَأَ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">مّ</span>َا <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لَّذِينَ فَسَقُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> فَمَأْوَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ىٰ</span>هُمُ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span><span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َارُ‌ۖ كُلَّم<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َآ</span> أَرَاد<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">ُوٓ</span><span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> أ<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">َن ي</span>َخْرُجُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> مِنْه<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َآ</span> أُعِيدُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> فِيهَا وَقِيلَ لَهُمْ ذُوقُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> عَذَابَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span><span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َارِ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لَّذِى كُ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">نت</span><span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa_shafawi\">ُم ب</span>ِه<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ِۦ</span> تُكَذِّب<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ُو</span>نَ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٢٠</span>"},{"id":21,"tajweed":"وَلَنُذِيقَ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َه<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_shafawi\">ُم م</span>ِّنَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْعَذَابِ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْأَ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">دْ</span>نَىٰ دُونَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْعَذَابِ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْأَكْبَرِ لَعَلَّهُمْ يَرْجِع<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ُو</span>نَ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٢١</span>"},{"id":22,"tajweed":"وَمَنْ أَظْلَمُ مِ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">مّ</span>َ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">ن ذ</span>ُكِّرَ بِـَٔـايَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>تِ رَبِّه<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ِۦ</span> ثُ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">مّ</span>َ أَعْرَضَ عَنْه<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َآ‌ۚ</span> إِ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َا مِنَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْمُ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">جْ</span>رِمِينَ مُ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">نت</span>َقِم<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ُو</span>نَ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٢٢</span>"},{"id":23,"tajweed":"وَلَقَ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">دْ</span> ءَاتَيْنَا مُوسَى <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْكِتَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>بَ فَلَا تَكُ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">ن ف</span>ِى مِرْيَ<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">ةٍ م</span>ّ<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_wo_ghunnah\">ِن ل</span>ِّق<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َا</span>ٓئِه<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ِۦ‌ۖ</span> وَجَعَلْنَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>هُ هُ<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_wo_ghunnah\">دًى ل</span>ِّبَن<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">ِىٓ</span> إِسْر<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َٰ</span>ٓء<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ِي</span>لَ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٢٣</span>"},{"id":24,"tajweed":"وَجَعَلْنَا مِنْهُمْ أَئِ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">مّ</span>َ<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">ةً ي</span>َهْدُونَ بِأَمْرِنَا لَ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">مّ</span>َا صَبَرُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ‌ۖ</span> وَكَانُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> بِـَٔـايَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>تِنَا يُوقِن<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ُو</span>نَ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٢٤</span>"},{"id":25,"tajweed":"إِ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َ رَبَّكَ هُوَ يَفْصِلُ بَيْنَهُمْ يَوْمَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْقِيَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>مَةِ فِيمَا كَانُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> فِيهِ يَخْتَلِف<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ُو</span>نَ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٢٥</span>"},{"id":26,"tajweed":"أَوَلَمْ يَهْدِ لَهُمْ كَمْ أَهْلَكْنَا مِ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">ن ق</span>َ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">بْ</span>لِه<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_shafawi\">ِم م</span>ِّنَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْقُرُونِ يَمْشُونَ فِى مَسَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>كِنِهِمْ‌ۚ إِ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َ فِى ذ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">َٰ</span>لِكَ لَأَيَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>تٍ‌ۖ أَفَلَا يَسْمَع<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ُو</span>نَ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٢٦</span>"},{"id":27,"tajweed":"أَوَلَمْ يَرَوْ<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> أَ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َا نَسُوقُ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْم<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َا</span>ٓءَ إِلَى <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْأَرْضِ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْجُرُزِ فَنُخْرِجُ بِه<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ِۦ</span> زَرْ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">عًا ت</span>َأْكُلُ مِنْهُ أَنْعَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>مُهُمْ وَأَ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">نف</span>ُسُهُمْ‌ۖ أَفَلَا يُ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">بْ</span>صِر<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ُو</span>نَ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٢٧</span>"},{"id":28,"tajweed":"وَيَقُولُونَ مَتَىٰ هَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>ذَا <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْفَتْحُ إِ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">ن ك</span>ُ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">نت</span>ُمْ صَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>دِق<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ِي</span>نَ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٢٨</span>"},{"id":29,"tajweed":"قُلْ يَوْمَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْفَتْحِ لَا يَ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">نف</span>َعُ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لَّذِينَ كَفَر<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">ُوٓ</span><span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> إِيمَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>نُهُمْ وَلَا هُمْ يُ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">نظ</span>َر<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ُو</span>نَ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٢٩</span>"},{"id":30,"tajweed":"فَأَعْرِضْ عَنْهُمْ وَ<span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">نت</span>َظِرْ إِ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َه<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_shafawi\">ُم م</span>ُّ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">نت</span>َظِر<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ُو</span>نَ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٣٠</span>"}]}